    <string name="disclosure_overlay_title">Lock Screen Permission Required</string>
    <string name="disclosure_overlay_desc">The Limitra app uses the \"Display Over Other Apps\" permission to stop you when trying to open blocked apps during your focus time and show a \"Lock Screen\" (shield). This permission is only required to keep you on the block screen.</string>
    <string name="disclosure_accessibility_title">Accessibility Service Required</string>
    <string name="disclosure_accessibility_desc">The Limitra app uses the Accessibility Service API to detect which app you open during your focus sessions and instantly close it if a blocked app is opened.\n\nIMPORTANT: This service monitors screen interactions on your device but does not collect, save, or share any of your personal or sensitive data (passwords, messages, etc.) with third parties.</string>
